message: "If you use Cortex as a design or implementation reference, please cite this software."
title: "Cortex: a cognition framework for long-running agents"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tan"
    given-names: "Renyi"
version: "0.33.0"
date-released: 2026-08-20
repository-code: "https://github.com/renyitan/cortex"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Cortex is a cognition plugin for long-running agents. It keeps canonical memory and work as
  operator-owned Markdown, derives removable local projections for retrieval and observability,
  and records explicit boundaries between host-enforced behavior and model-owned cognition.
keywords:
  - "agent memory"
  - "context management"
  - "cognition framework"
  - "GitHub Copilot CLI"
